{%- comment -%}
  Colour-filter swatch map, shared by the collection filters (snippets/filter-color-swatch.liquid)
  and the Rebuy search filters (window.phColorSwatchMap in layout/theme.liquid).
  Output: "handle~value|handle~value…", where value is a hex colour or an image URL.
  Colours not listed here fall back to a "{handle}.png" image in Settings > Files.
  Capture it and `strip` before splitting.

  'multi' reuses the colour-wheel asset the base.css mapping already points at.
{%- endcomment -%}
